basics: 
there is a shop at the start, and you can buy pieces with points
if you lose all your king, you lose. 

Chess: starts with a chess king, and 250 points of material
no special ability

shogi: starts with a shogi king, and 200 points of material
speical ability is to be able to capture half of the point cost of the enemy pieces. 

Xiangqi: starts with a xiangqi king, and two guards. 200 points of material
no special ability

